{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"The|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"reigns|strong=\"H4427\"!  \nHe|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"clothed|strong=\"H3847\"with|strong=\"H3847\"majesty|strong=\"H1348\"!  \nThe|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"armed|strong=\"H3847\"with|strong=\"H3847\"strength|strong=\"H5797\".  \nThe|strong=\"H3068\"world|strong=\"H8398\"also|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"established|strong=\"H3559\".  \nIt|strong=\"H3559\"can’t be|strong=\"H3068\"moved|strong=\"H4131\".   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"Your|strong=\"H3559\"throne|strong=\"H3678\"is|strong=\"H3678\"established|strong=\"H3559\"from|strong=\"H3678\"long|strong=\"H5769\"ago|strong=\"H5769\".  \nYou|strong=\"H5769\"are|strong=\"H3678\"from|strong=\"H3678\"everlasting|strong=\"H5769\".   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"The|strong=\"H5375\"floods|strong=\"H5104\"have|strong=\"H3068\"lifted|strong=\"H5375\"up|strong=\"H5375\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\",  \nthe|strong=\"H5375\"floods|strong=\"H5104\"have|strong=\"H3068\"lifted|strong=\"H5375\"up|strong=\"H5375\"their|strong=\"H3068\"voice|strong=\"H6963\".  \nThe|strong=\"H5375\"floods|strong=\"H5104\"lift|strong=\"H5375\"up|strong=\"H5375\"their|strong=\"H3068\"waves|strong=\"H1796\".   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"Above|strong=\"H4791\"the|strong=\"H3068\"voices|strong=\"H6963\"of|strong=\"H3068\"many|strong=\"H7227\"waters|strong=\"H4325\",  \nthe|strong=\"H3068\"mighty|strong=\"H7227\"breakers|strong=\"H4867\"of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"sea|strong=\"H3220\",  \nthe|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"on|strong=\"H3068\"high|strong=\"H4791\"is|strong=\"H3068\"mighty|strong=\"H7227\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"Your|strong=\"H3068\"statutes stand firm.  \nHoliness|strong=\"H6944\"adorns your|strong=\"H3068\"house|strong=\"H1004\",  \nLORD|strong=\"H3068\", forever|strong=\"H3117\"more|strong=\"H3966\".   \n"}]}
